# SP-1 | BrowseComp+ (830) | Document REPL agent | Qwen3.6-35B-A3B (medium) | Reason-ModernColBERT 8192 (:8766) behind the
#   search-policy proxy: novelty filter + Qwen3-Reranker-4B over ColBERT's top 30, scored against
#   "<question> / Current search: <query>" (studies/search_policy/src/rerank_proxy.py)
# Control: BCP-29 (the same agent, prompt and split runner on plain ColBERT :8766).
# model: qwen36-35b-a3b served by vLLM on :8030 (GPU 0), --backend openai; effort medium sent as reasoning_effort
#   (OpenAI client forwards sampling_args); presence_penalty 1.5; SUP_FENCE_TOLERANT=1, SUP_MAX_BLOCKS=5
# caps: --max-searches 10, --max-iterations 30 (+1 forced final answer), k model-chosen 1..50 (fallback 5),
#   --max-timeout 5400, --lm-timeout 1800, subprocess kill 6300 s (record config: prompt_id 94f31e91f6b7)
# split runner: src/split_runner.py --seed-split <split> (unchanged seed prompt). FINGERPRINT / cache key depend on the
#   retrieval URL (it is part of BASE_ARGS): :8768 -> 9ee941fc / 4512373504 (test200), :8772 -> 3146c6e8 / 08b583387f
#   (test_rest, rest300, pareto, feedback); both reproduced by tests/test_follow_up_configs.py.
# slices (816 records; 830 - 816 count wrong): test200 197 records (2026-10-10, proxy :8768 on GPU 0, 20 workers),
#   test_rest 324 (10-11/12, proxy :8772 on GPU 1, 12 workers), pareto 56 and feedback 44 (10-12..14, :8772, 10 then
#   12 workers per resume), rest300 195 (10-14..20, :8772, 24 workers; merged pareto/feedback continuation).
# proxy: POLICY=novelty+rerank DEPTH=30 RERANK_MODEL Qwen/Qwen3-Reranker-4B (default) MAX_DOC_TOK=1024 (default);
#   :8768 RERANK_BATCH=6 RERANK_MEM_FRACTION=0.15 (one search at a time; that proxy version is NOT preserved, F-C);
#   :8772 RERANK_TOK_BUDGET=8000 RERANK_MEM_FRACTION=0.15 (cross-request batching). Which file state of the proxy served
#   each later slice: UNKNOWN (studies/search_policy/CHANGES_FROM_ORIGINAL.md SP-I1).
# caveat: 2026-10-14 12:22-14:25 UTC a FRAMES run with 16 workers shared vLLM :8030 (more timeouts in that window).
# judge: gpt-4.1 (logs/bcp_rejudge_gpt41/17.json); superseded: Qwen3.6 verdicts in each cache.json.
# vLLM server: benchmarks/models/serve_qwen36.sh (262,144 context, 16,384-token output cap); gpu-memory-utilization per slice
#   UNKNOWN (the saved server log of the 10-13 restart shows 0.7).
# original output: <original repo>/logs/{bcp_policy_e2e,bcp_testrest_rr,bcp_rest300_rr,bcp_pareto_rr,bcp_feedback_rr}
ROW_ID=SP-1
BENCHMARK=browsecomp_plus
ENTRY=src/split_runner.py
LAUNCHER="studies/search_policy/experiments/sp1_bcp_qwen36_rerank.sh <test200|test_rest|pareto|feedback|rest300> (starts the proxy, then experiments/bcp_qwen36_split.sh)"
CONTROL=BCP-29
CACHE_KEY="4512373504 (test200); 08b583387f (test_rest, rest300, pareto, feedback)"
FINGERPRINT="9ee941fc (:8768); 3146c6e8 (:8772)"
ROOT_MODEL=qwen36-35b-a3b
SUB_MODEL=qwen36-35b-a3b
REASONING_EFFORT=medium
SUB_REASONING_EFFORT=medium
EFFORT_SENT=medium
RETRIEVER="Reason-ModernColBERT PLAID 8192 (src/retrieval_server_colbert.py :8766) behind the rerank proxy"
SERVER="http://127.0.0.1:8768 (test200); http://127.0.0.1:8772 (other slices)"
POLICY=novelty+rerank
DEPTH=30
RERANK_MODEL=Qwen/Qwen3-Reranker-4B
MAX_DOC_TOK=1024
PROXY_8768="RERANK_BATCH=6 RERANK_MEM_FRACTION=0.15 (code version not preserved; RERANK_XBATCH=0 selects the closest path)"
PROXY_8772="RERANK_TOK_BUDGET=8000 RERANK_MEM_FRACTION=0.15"
MAX_SEARCHES=10
MAX_ITERATIONS=30
MAX_TIMEOUT=5400
GEPA_BCP_SERVERS=http://localhost:8030/v1
GEPA_BCP_MODEL=qwen36-35b-a3b
SUP_FENCE_TOLERANT=1
SUP_MAX_BLOCKS=5
SUP_PRESENCE_PENALTY=1.5
WORKERS="20 (test200), 12 (test_rest), 10 then 12 (pareto, feedback), 24 (rest300)"
SPLIT_FILES="studies/prompt_optimisation/splits/bcp_gepa_splits/split.json; studies/prompt_optimisation/splits/bcp_full830/split_rest300.json"
RUN_ARGS='--design B --server <proxy URL> --backend openai --api-key-env ALIBABA_TOKEN --root-model qwen36-35b-a3b --sub-model qwen36-35b-a3b --reasoning-effort medium --sub-reasoning-effort medium --max-iterations 30 --max-searches 10 --seed-context --compaction --grounding-gate --lean-prologue --no-delegation --solo-prompt --no-orchestrator --compaction-threshold-pct 0.85 --max-concurrent-subcalls 4 --max-timeout 5400 --lm-timeout 1800 --save-trajectory'
ENV_UNSET='GEPA_PROMPTS'
ORIGINAL_OUTPUT="<original repo>/logs/{bcp_policy_e2e,bcp_testrest_rr,bcp_rest300_rr,bcp_pareto_rr,bcp_feedback_rr}"
